problem_statement:
Ignore unbound VkVertexInputBindingDescription
From https://gitlab.khronos.org/vulkan/vulkan/-/issues/4132 there were new CTS added (`dEQP-VK.pipeline.*.vertex_input.misc.unused_binding*`) that show if you have 

```c++
// VkVertexInputBindingDescription
input_bindings[0].binding = 0;
input_bindings[1].binding = 1;

// VkVertexInputAttributeDescription
input_attributes[0].binding = 0
input_attributes[0].location = 0
input_attributes[1].binding = 0
input_attributes[1].location = 1
```

If the app only calls `vkCmdBindVertexBuffers` for binding 0, this is still valid because binding 1 is not referenced by any Locations

